# This directory is symlinked to ~/.config/fcitx5/conf, so fcitx5 addons write
# their runtime config here (pinyin.conf, punctuation.conf, classicui.conf, ...).
# Only the files this repo owns are tracked; everything else is per-device
# runtime state — classicui.conf included, because the desktop theme scripts
# (omarchy-theme-set-fcitx5, nbshell theme-hook.sh) rewrite it in place.
*
!.gitignore
!kimpanel.conf
